# Ignore all data folders (anywhere in the project)
**/data/

# Ignore generated model artifacts but keep models/README.md tracked
models/*
!models/README.md
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.pickle

# Ignore generated metric/report CSVs
**/reports/*.csv
**/reports/
